            <ArticleTitle>Medial peritalar dislocation in a volleyball player.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>314-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a medial peritalar dislocation, which was treated with closed reduction and cast for 3 weeks. At follow up 12 months later, there was normal range of motion and mild pain after prolonged walking.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
